  "id": "spiced-potato-frittata",
  "name": "Spiced Potato Frittata",
  "subtitle": "A quick skillet frittata with potatoes, spinach, tomato, and warm spices.",
  "description": "Tender potatoes and vegetables are folded into eggs, finished under the grill, and served with a tangy mango-yogurt accompaniment.",
